From os9-freeware Sat Aug 16 00:00:00 1986From: The OS-9 Freeware Collection <os9-freeware>To: testerSubject: Welcome -- this is a real mail folderDate: Sat, 16 Aug 1986 00:00:00This message exists so that Elm has something to show you.Elm reads mail from a folder; this is one, at /dd/SPOOL/MAIL/<user>.Try:    frm             who your mail is from, one line each    messages        what is in the folder    elm             the full-screen reader.  `q' quits it.Nothing here delivers mail to you -- that is a separate job, and/dd/CMDS/UUCP is what does it, over a serial line, to another machinethat also speaks UUCP.  On this disk, under an emulator, there is noserial line, so this folder is as far as the story goes.Delete this message whenever you like; it is an ordinary file.